# The PRESETS knob on the Tonic picks a place; a question asks first (OCT+ = YES, OCT- = NO).
# The test bank (tests/fixtures/bank): 01 SYNTH FILL TEST 120 BPM, 02 SYNTH SLOW 90, 03 SYNTH FAST 150.
# wip665: since 655 only places 1-2 are demo presets (from the bank); places 3-8 are ordinary EMPTY user places: an empty place loads
# the sound of the bank preset (place - 1) mod 8 mod 3 (the bank has 3) with no steps: place 3 = like 03 (150 BPM), place 4 = like 01 (120 BPM).
wait 300
expect tempo 125
# turn: a question, nothing changes yet
turn PRESET 1
wait 100
shot preset_ask.png
expect tempo 125
# NO: nothing changed
tap OCT-
wait 100
expect tempo 125
# turn up to the second preset (from none: 1, then 2), YES
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET 1
tap OCT+
wait 100
expect tempo 90
expect vfill0.0.4 1
expect dirty 0   # wip310: a loaded place is written to the flash at once (so the place survives power-off)
# the next one: place 3 = an empty place, it loads like the bank's 03 (150 BPM, no steps)
turn PRESET 1
tap OCT+
wait 100
expect tempo 150
# turning twice while asking moves the choice (at the end it stays on the last: 03), then back down to 01
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET -1
tap OCT+
wait 100
expect tempo 120
# the knob goes round and round through all 30 places; an empty user place (04 EMPTY) can be loaded: the sound of the bank's 01 (120 BPM), no steps
# (only a missing DEMO place, 1-2, can not be uploaded: the test bank has both, so that case is not reachable here)
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 100
shot preset_empty.png
tap OCT+
wait 100
expect tempo 120
expect presetcur 4
# back to place 1: three steps down, YES
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
tap OCT+
wait 100
expect presetcur 1
# one turn down from 01 = 30 (the last place, empty): round the end
turn PRESET -1
wait 100
shot preset_wrap.png
tap OCT-
# playing: turning works; UPLOAD asks "CHANGE PRESETS?" first; OCT- = NO keeps everything
tap PLAY
wait 200
turn PRESET 1
tap OCT+
wait 100
shot preset_playing_ask.png
expect tempo 120
expect playing 1
tap OCT-
wait 100
expect playing 1
expect tempo 120
# OCT+ = YES: the playing stops and the preset is loaded
turn PRESET 1
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
wait 500
expect playing 0
expect tempo 90
expect presetcur 2
